OL,3,AKatie Zacharia leaving her White House
OL,4,Arole less than five days on the job
OL,5,
OL,6,FKatie Zacharia will be leaving her post
OL,7,Fas White House press secretary, the BBC
OL,8,Fhas confirmed, as the fallout from her
OL,9,Fshaky public debut appears to have
OL,10,Freached its climax.
OL,12,FSpeaking to reporters moments before
OL,13,Fnews of her exit dropped on Friday,
OL,14,FPresident Donald Trump said he had told
OL,15,Fher "you don't have to do this if you
OL,16,Fdon't want to" and "honestly, if I were
OL,17,Fyou, I'd reconsider".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
