OL,3,AKatie Zacharia leaving her White House
OL,4,Arole less than five days on the job
OL,5,
OL,6,FZacharia faced heavy criticism for her
OL,7,Ffirst press briefing in the role on
OL,8,FTuesday, which lasted less than 15
OL,9,Fminutes and included only three
OL,10,Fquestions from reporters.
OL,12,FShe spent the days after playing
OL,13,Fdefence, answering tough questions from
OL,14,Fnews outlets about her credentials and
OL,15,Fpreparedness for the job.
